  "[says] Wang Lung demands to know why his sons have not worked on the land.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now why have you not planted rice this spring on my land and why have you not harvested wheat and why have you not ploughed my fields?\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung observes his sons' wealth.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now I have heard it all,\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and what now, and what now?\"",
